        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>HES 5104, HES 5000 Series Press Fit  Sackable Lip Extension</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis is a Sackable Lip Extension for HES 5000 Series Electric Strikes. Choose from a 1/2 inch extension, a 1 inch extension, or a 1-1/4 inch extension. They can be stacked in any combination to achieve the lip length that you require. Easy to install, they just snap right on to a HES 5000 Series Strike.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nCan Be Used With:<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/low-profile-electric-strike-for-cylindrical-locksets-in-aluminum-frames-hes-5000dc630-501a\"><b>HES 5000DC630501A,  Electric Strike for Cylindrical Locksets in Aluminum Frames</b></a> or <br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/low-profile-electric-strike-for-cylindrical-locksets-in-ansi-metal-jambs-hes-5000dc630-501\"><b>HES 5000DC630-501, Electric Strike for Cylindrical Locksets in ANSI Metal Jambs</b></a> \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<b>5104-1/2</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>1/2\" Stackable Lip Extension</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>5104-1</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>1\" Stackable Lip Extension</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>5104-1-1/4</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>1-1/4\" Stackable Lip Extension</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</1>\r\n</p>",
